{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"three-phase-power-calculator UI copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer","detected_language":"tl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"three-phase-power-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer","keys":["three-phase-power-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer"],"locale":"fil","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"> Oo. Active kapangyarihan ay maliwanag na kapangyarihan na pinarami sa pamamagitan ng kapangyarihan kadahilanan. Mas mababang kapangyarihan kadahilanan ay nangangahulugan ng mas kaunting aktibong kapangyarihan para sa parehong linya boltahe at kasalukuyang; reactive-power magnitude ay tinatayang mula sa S × √ (ZXQPH0000QXZ - PF²).","record_id":"50560303cf23c8f0fb7249cad6007ea32ed7e420acfb5da46b1fd27338896262","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":1.477889174125039,"source":"Yes. Active power is apparent power multiplied by power factor. Lower power factor means less active power for the same line voltage and current; reactive-power magnitude is estimated from S × √(1 − PF²).","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"c869fab54372ba075b2321817d380f944fc81baca326e5337c0e24e2e18a7928","status":"machine-draft","translation":"> Oo. Active kapangyarihan ay maliwanag na kapangyarihan na pinarami sa pamamagitan ng kapangyarihan kadahilanan. Mas mababang kapangyarihan kadahilanan ay nangangahulugan ng mas kaunting aktibong kapangyarihan para sa parehong linya boltahe at kasalukuyang; reactive-power magnitude ay tinatayang mula sa S × √ (1 - PF²).","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
